# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository; let git decide text vs binary.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The Runes vendoring tool is checked byte for byte against its pin (skills/jarl/scripts/vendor/runes.pin.json),
# so no checkout may touch its line endings. The fragment blocks in SKILL.md need no entry: their check ignores CRLF.
skills/jarl/scripts/runes.mjs -text

# Every change adds its lines under [Unreleased]; only a release writes a version heading, so a union never interleaves two sections.
/CHANGELOG.md merge=union
